  <item>
    <title>嘴里叼辆车，脸上在施工，这钱花得值！025</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685b98144abe6e29cbee0513</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685b98144abe6e29cbee0513</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 25 Jun 2025 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>上一期的消费主旨是毛骨悚然，这一期是匪夷所思。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人为了安全感买假珠宝，结果心虚到又买了真珠宝。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人投资理财，结果最大的消费是“投资自己”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>有人花5年整牙，直接“叼走一辆车”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>从“恢复出厂设置”的近视手术，到医美医生对闺蜜的脸发出“禁止施工”警告......</span></p><span></span><p><span>这届消费者，花钱买快乐的方式，比你想象的更神奇！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="44">00:44</a> 我的闺蜜suzanna是梵克雅宝批发商！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="393">06:33</a> 收纳的尽头是......囤积症博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> 小黑姐姐最大的消费仍然是投资</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="853">14:13</a> 脉脉的脑洞是修仙伴手礼么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1107">18:27</a> 闺蜜群人均嘴里叼着一辆小汽车，但整牙这钱花得值！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1655">27:35</a> 人均恢复出厂设置，近视手术这钱也值！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2032">33:52</a> 医生不仅会识人，还会看表开药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> 整形医生对Suzanna灵魂判决：“你这张脸是艺术品，禁止施工！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2786">46:26</a> &nbsp;“这钱还真不是我能赚的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3184">53:04</a> &nbsp;总之，只要花钱能换来快乐，那就值！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/665c126194977a26ef97f2ff/lhO-B2eo_mh4WIIVLfR-WXysEnvW.m4a" length="57276901" type="audio/mp4"/>
