  <item>
    <title>013. 产后第一年，轻舟撞击万重山</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e18e21ee04007d88d56e91</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e18e21ee04007d88d56e91</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我（晓晓）的宝宝一周岁了，疲惫喜悦交织之际，做了这期播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 晓晓像一台24小时运转的机器，关注着孩子成长所有细枝末节的琐碎，不再有任何时间分给自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 玻璃渣里找糖吃，脉脉开始做夹子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 有后妈就有后爹，我们都要注意身体健康啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 处女座的J人脉脉，伙同产后激素把家人逼疯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1182">19:42</a> 圆头扁头上扁头，头骨怎么就不能像面团一样呢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1440">24:00</a> 听一下吧，晓晓在这又把脉脉讲到泪流满面。</span></p>]]></description>
